Z||000001||Jefrysuko||11-28-2001||01:09 AM||||Actually the bolt pattern isn't the same.  The Fiero is 100 x 5 where the Grand Prix is 115 x 5.  You might want to consider the rim's off a older Grand Am.  They have the same bolt pattern and come is sizes up to 16".  There is a red Grand Am that usually parks by the bus stop that has a set which I think would look good.<P>By the way when we going to meet so I can get that tranny off of you?||||reg||1
