Z||000004||Standard||11-28-2001||02:35 AM||||It's the grand am's, beretta's and cavaliers that have the 5x100 bolt pattern, at least cars before 2000 I think.  All the W-body stuff (lumina, grand prix, monte carlo etc(I think it's W)) is 5x115<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">          <BR><FONT COLOR="red">1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed</FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="white">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
